//\nVol, célérité\nAu début du combat pendant votre tour, vous pouvez mettre sur le champ de bataille une carte d'artefact de votre main. Si c'est un équipement, attachez-le à L'invincible Iron Man.","type":"Legendary Creature — Human Artificer Hero // Legendary Artifact Creature — Human Hero","type_fr":"","ub":true,"versions":4},{"classeur":0,"combos":[{"autres":[],"bracket":3,"cartes":["Scourge of the Throne","Helm of the Host"],"description":"At the beginning of your combat phase, Helm of the Host triggers, creating a token copy of Scourge of the Throne with haste.\nDeclare the Scourge of the Throne token as an attacker, attacking the opponent with the most life or an opponent that is tied for the most life.\nThe Scourge of the Throne token's first and second abilities trigger.\nResolve the first trigger, giving the token +1/+1 until end of turn.\nResolve the second trigger, causing you to untap all attacking creatures and to get an additional combat phase after this one.\nRepeat each combat phase.","id":"1405-1692","identite":"R","lien":"https://commanderspellbook.com/combo/1405-1692/","mana":"","manque":["Scourge of the Throne"],"popularite":7503,"prerequis":"","prerequis2":"Your life total is at most five.\nYou have the lowest life total or are tied for the lowest life total.","produit":["Infinite combat phases","Infinite creature tokens with haste","Infinite creature ETB"],"tag":"Spicy"}],"commandant":false,"couleurs":["R"],"cout":"{4}{R}{R}","dans":null,"edition":{"annee":"2026","icone":"https://svgs.scryfall.io/sets/fdc.svg?1793595600","nom":"Foundations Commander","num":"173","rarete":"m","set":"fdc"},"foil":false,"fonctions":[],"fr":"Fléau du trône","gc":false,"groupes":["combos"],"image":"https://cards.scryfall.io/normal/front/b/5/b54f99f7-f579-466d-93b5-a856268b3851.jpg?1789753097","image_dos":"","legal":"legal","mv":6.0,"nom":"Scourge of the Throne","note":0.551,"partenaire":false,"petite":"https://cards.scryfall.io/small/front/b/5/b54f99f7-f579-466d-9